build('E412','Psycholinguistics','Psycholinguistics','Psycholinguistics connects language knowledge with mental processing, development and the brain. Begin with how people comprehend and produce language, then compare explanations of L1 and L2 learning, individual differences and patterns of language impairment.',['Observe the processes: comprehension, production and acquisition.','Trace development: early communication, words and increasingly complex patterns.','Compare explanations: biological, cognitive and social learning accounts.','Explain variation: age, motivation, memory, context and neural organisation.'],groups412,rows412,ess412,challenge412,extras)
